「够了！\n人家可是有认真问的」%K%P
To tell the truth, the answer did pop into my mind.%K%P
其实，头脑中是有答案出现的。%K%P
That I loved her. And how couldn't I?%K%P
『喜欢啊』、\n『那还用说么』什么的…%K%P
However, right before I could voice that, I felt as though\nsomething had grabbed hold of my vocal cords to stop me\nfrom speaking up.%K%P
只是，这些话在说出口之前，\n不知为何声带就被扼住了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry, Toko...\nBut I can't answer that.\d%K%P
